OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian says shopkeeper deserves
OL,4,Agold medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouble Olympic gold medallist Matt
OL,7,FWeston has said a Kent shopkeeper
OL,8,Fdeserved one of his medals after
OL,9,Fhelping raise more than #1.4m for
OL,10,FNational Lottery good causes.
OL,12,FThe skeleton racer surprised Steve
OL,13,FWeight at Borough Green Stores as part
OL,14,Fof a campaign recognising independent
OL,15,Fretailers across the UK.
OL,17,FWeight has run the shop near Sevenoaks
OL,18,Ffor 32 years and generated the #1.4m
OL,19,Fthrough lottery ticket sales, where 23p
OL,20,Fof every pound spent on the draw goes
OL,21,Fto good causes.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
