OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian says shopkeeper deserves
OL,4,Agold medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeston, who grew up in nearby Sevenoaks
OL,7,Fand benefited from funding through UK
OL,8,FSport's Elite Athletes programme, said
OL,9,Fit had been vital to his success.
